    fix(calendar): name expired requests and keep welcome copy to welcome bookings
    
    - Opus B-367-1: add the backend 'expired' status to SchedulingSessionStatus
      and label it 'Request closed, your coach did not answer in time' in
      Calendar and the session view (the push tap target), with a Pick another
      time action, instead of 'Status unavailable'.
    - Sol B-367-1: the welcome heading and the welcome_call_booked tutorial
      signal follow the type actually booked, so a regular type picked from the
      welcome fallback reads as that type and does not complete the welcome step.
    - Opus C-367-2: booking confirmation says the coach sees it in the booking
      inbox, where coaches actually see new bookings.

